                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{LHS}&=1+5+5^2+\\cdots+5^{k-1}+5^{k+1-1}\\\\&=\\frac14(5^k-1)+5^{k+1-1}&&\\text{using assumption}\\\\&=\\frac14(5^k-1+4\\times5^{k+1-1})\\\\&=\\frac14(5^k-1+4\\times5^k)\\\\&=\\frac14(5\\times5^k-1)\\\\&=\\frac14(5^{k+1}-1)\\\\&=\\mathrm{RHS}\\end{aligned}",
